  "guide": "Here `Limit` is $A$ and `completedRootPureState` is $\\omega$ bundled with its purity proof. `PureState.selectedRepresentation completedRootPureState` is the family $(\\pi_j)_{j\\in I}$. The RHS `atomicRepresentation` assembles this family into $\\pi$ on `SelectedAtomicHilbert`, which is $\\mathcal H$. Coordinate inclusions $e_j$ are the separately defined `selectedEmbedding`; they are used to state the coordinate restriction formula.",
